<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" style="overflow-y: hidden;">
<head><meta><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Email Template</title>
	<style type="text/css">body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      color: #333333;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px 0;
    }
    .header img {
      max-width: 150px;
      height: auto;
    }
    .main-content h1 {
      background-color: #134058;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 15px;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
    .section {
      padding: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background-color: #134058;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin-top: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .two-column {
      display: flex;
      gap: 15px;
      padding: 20px 0;
    }
    .two-column img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
    .two-column-content {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 10px;
    }
    .two-column-image-container {
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 120px;
    }
    .trusted-lender-section {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 20px 0;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 15px;
    }
    .trusted-lender-section img {
      max-width: 100%;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666666;
      padding: 20px 0;
    }
	</style>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<div class="container">
<div class="header"><img alt="Company Logo" src="https://ppmg.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015PZ000002yf8o&oid=00D30000000pfXl&lastMod=1730128474000" /></div>

<div class="main-content">
<h1>Where Do We Go From Here?</h1>

<div class="section">
<p>Hello,</p>

<p>I hope this email finds you well. My team has tried to contact you several times in recent months but hasn&rsquo;t been able to get in touch. I wanted to connect with you from our last conversation and get a better game plan together for your portfolio moving forward. If now isn&rsquo;t the right time, when should we revisit?</p>

<p>An update from our end: we have made forward commitments with a few lenders to offer 5.38% interest rates at no cost to you. If one did want to buy the rate down further, you could get as low as 4.75% with 3 points. This rate could help position your investments to take advantage of growth to come.</p>

<p>I understand now isn&#39;t the right time for everyone, and that&#39;s ok. If it&#39;s not, when should we revisit? If it is, what does your availability look like this week to schedule a call? If you don&#39;t want me to contact you, just say so, that&#39;s ok as well.</p>

<p>Thanks, and I look forward to better serving you.</p>

<p>Best,</p>

<p>Taz</p>
</div>

<div class="section two-column">
<div class="two-column-content">
<h3><img alt="Investor Resources" src="https://ppmg.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015PZ000002yfaD&oid=00D30000000pfXl&lastMod=1730128610000" style="width: 339px; height: 241.531px;" /><br />
Company Overview and Market Details</h3>

<p>Click the link below to see our current stats and learn about what markets we are currently offering investment opportunities in.</p>
<a class="cta-button" href="#">Download Investor Resource</a></div>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>Your Next Step</h2>

<p>Take a look at our trusted lenders:</p>

