<div><img alt="Boston Taylor" src="https://ppmg.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015PZ000002yd0Y&oid=00D30000000pfXl&lastMod=1730128587000" /></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="section two-column">
<div class="two-column-content">
<h3><img alt="Private Facebook Group" src="https://ppmg.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015PZ000002yfdR&oid=00D30000000pfXl&lastMod=1730128650000" style="width: 261px; height: 184px;" /><br />
Private Facebook Group For Investors</h3>

<p>This is a great group for connecting and sharing with like-minded investors. Enjoy live videos, articles, and conversations with over 6,000 members.</p>
<a class="cta-button" href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/reinationgroup">Join Group</a></div>
</div>
</div>

